==Battleground==
*8 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*4 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Pigge Victorious|Pigge Victoriouses]] spawn after 15 seconds<sup>450f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Heavenly Le'saint]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
**1 [[Selena]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**1 [[Bang-Bang]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**1 [[Bang-Bang]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The start-off spawns multiple mostly non-threatening [[Red Enemies]], they can be farmed for money using [[Double Bounty]] units like [[Bullet Train Cat]] or [[Goemon Cat]] while some slower long-ranged attackers can be built up.

The boss has very high DPS, especially when [[Strengthen|Strengthened]], so [[:Category:Meatshield-class Cats|Meatshields]] like [[Eraser Cat]] or [[Manic Eraser Cat]] should be used like normal to protect attackers that outrange him and his support, such as [[Paris Cat]], [[King Dragon Cat]], [[Macho Leg Cat]], or either of the latter two's Crazed or Brainwashed versions.

[[Ramen Cat]] will reinforce the defense significantly and will help with attacking as well, and while the supporting enemies will kill him quickly at first, only one Selena and two Bang-Bang's spawn, making the stage pressure much smaller once they die If the Red support causes trouble, the generic backliners along with [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|Anti-Red Cats]] such as [[Courier Cat]] or [[Elemental Duelist Cat]] (will deal with the boss as well if [[Talents|Talentned]]) can be used to kill them as well the boss more quickly. Once they are controlled and the one-time support is dead, the stage is simply an endurance battle against Le'saint.

